title: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Replace a document or mark it not available
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 5, Documents list)
intro: Two more buttons on a document row. 'Replace' swaps a file for another one and Reader reads it again. 'Mark not available' says the document does not exist, with a short reason. The checklist counts it as handled, and the review warns when the payer requires it.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 3, look at a document row"
decision dRow "Does the row have a file?"

group gReplace "Replace"
  click cRep "Click 'Replace' (next to the eye and the x)"
  input iFile "Choose one file in the picker"
  process pSwap "The new file takes the old file's place in that slot"
  agent aRead "Reader reads the new file for about 1 second\nRow shows 'Reader is reading'"
  process pClean "Demo: a replacement is read clean\nRow shows 'NEW FILE · N checks passed'"
  decision dAfter "Had the agents already run?"
  toast tStale "'Records changed after the agents ran'\n'Their work was cleared. The agents check again when you continue.'"
endgroup

group gMark "Mark not available"
  click cMark "Click 'Mark not available'\n(on an empty row, next to 'Add file' and 'Use sample file')"
  overlay oWhy "Editor opens under the row\n'Why is it not available?' with a box, 'Mark not available' and 'Cancel'"
  input iWhy "Type a few words, up to 80 characters\n'For example: the patient has not had one done yet'"
  decision dText "Is there a reason?"
  process pOff "'Mark not available' stays switched off"
  click cDo "Click 'Mark not available', or press Enter"
  click cEsc "Click 'Cancel', or press Escape in the box"
  process pNo "Editor closes; nothing changes"
  store stMark "The reason is saved with the case\nAny file in that slot is taken out"
endgroup

group gRow "What the row and the page say"
  decision dReq "Does the payer's list require the document?"
  process rReq "Row shows an amber box\n'Marked not available: REASON · Summit asks for it, so the review will warn.'"
  process rRec "Row shows a ticked box\n'Marked not available: REASON · You can sign without it.'"
  process pReady "Counts as ready in 'N of M ready'\nIt is not listed as 'Not in yet' in the footer"
  click cUndo "Click 'Undo'"
  process pUndo "The mark is removed\nThe row is missing again"
  click cAdd "Click 'Add file'\nThe file replaces the mark"
endgroup

goto gRev "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › Validation summary and checks"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › An agent asks a question"
goto gRec "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Clinical summary and document rows"

s1 --> dRow
dRow -->|Yes| cRep --> iFile --> pSwap --> aRead --> pClean --> dAfter
dAfter -->|Yes| tStale
dAfter -->|No| gRec
tStale --> gRec
dRow -->|No| cMark --> oWhy --> iWhy --> dText
dText -->|No| pOff --> iWhy
dText -->|Yes| cDo --> stMark --> dReq
oWhy --> cEsc --> pNo
dReq -->|Yes| rReq --> pReady
dReq -->|No, recommended| rRec --> pReady
pReady --> cUndo --> pUndo --> dRow
pReady --> cAdd --> pSwap
rReq --> gRev
pReady -.->|No psychiatric evaluation, or no document for the lower-level reason| gQ
